page('articles','Articles','Practical articles on dependent types, higher-order logic, formal graph semantics, and the trust boundary of AI agents.',ph('Field notes','The reasoning behind<br><em class="accent">the engineering.</em>','Original guides to the ideas that connect graphs, ontologies, and checked evidence. Start anywhere; follow the references when you want to go deeper.')+'<div class="container page-content">'+article_cards(ARTICLES)+'</div>','/articles/')
